==Overview==
[[Mutant Toilet (Unit)]] is a Mythic unit that was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]].

== Appearance ==
The toilet seems to have a yellow outfit with an armored chest(?) with its arm being fused to a multi-weapon tool which seems to have a saw and a blaster above its arm. There also something on its back, assumably a weapon(?) based on its appearance.

==Obtainment==
You can summon it from [[Noob Toilet Crate]] with a chance of 0.5%.

